1
00:00:00,055 --> 00:00:01,385
(Raj:)That was my last hope.

2
00:00:01,973 --> 00:00:04,603
I'm gonna be deported.
Sent home in disgrace.

3
00:00:04,768 --> 00:00:07,728
(Raj:)Exposed to the sardonic barbs
of my cousin Sanjay.

4
00:00:07,896 --> 00:00:11,276
(Raj:)Or as you may know him,
Dave from AT&T Customer Service.

5
00:00:17,239 --> 00:00:20,239
-I'm really gonna miss you.
-Will you come visit me in India?

6
00:00:21,576 --> 00:00:24,576
(Howard:)Gee, that's like a 17-hour flight.

7
00:00:24,746 --> 00:00:26,126
(Howard:)How about I meet you halfway?

8
00:00:26,289 --> 00:00:28,539
(Raj:)Halfway is 600 miles
off the coast of Japan.

9
00:00:29,626 --> 00:00:31,586
(Howard:)Tell you what, we'll Skype.

10
00:00:34,881 --> 00:00:36,261
(Sheldon(arriving):)-Gentlemen.
-Hey.

11
00:00:36,424 --> 00:00:39,134
(Sheldon:)Raj, did you get the job
with Professor Laughlin?

12
00:00:39,302 --> 00:00:41,762
(Howard:)-No.
-I assumed as much, but never fear.

13
00:00:41,930 --> 00:00:45,980
(Sheldon:)Like the subordinate male protagonist
in action movies who disappears...

14
00:00:46,142 --> 00:00:50,442
...halfway through the second reel,
I have returned to save the day.

15
00:00:53,275 --> 00:00:56,115
(Sheldon:)Odd. Usually he's met by cheers.

16
00:00:56,444 --> 00:01:00,154
(Sheldon:)Anyway, I was thinking about exploring
the string theory implications...

